  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-painting-class-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7684b35648ce28aa5bf3cd47811b45e98080b6d24a52fe8c2983c4358ee7079d",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9dba03aa8dc808466dcbbf8d848aaeae215d8f8456e5a5ad09fc0dc0ee4938dc",
      "text": "悟空的\n画画课",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d4ba5f652897f40c3bcb0903906bfec7871770c705df20f0f81ede97c1f275a1",
      "text": "老师摆好纸和颜料。\n“今天，你们想画什么？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "df61c37cf7d4a0aec8792f1120692ba227d8cda36dfbcd1b88af07fca03c9d81",
      "text": "哪吒拿起画笔。\n“我要画独角兽，\n头发要像彩虹一样！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "747fb17e9d34f777fbdbabad9356b552faf4c2f9f646bbd66edf75db65172870",
      "text": "“我画小兔子！”八戒说。\n“瞧，这两只长耳朵！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b9271a26d880c6f65942e935827c1ddcf1a55078360da7763d8cd864e79f0f09",
      "text": "悟空一听，眼睛亮了。\n“我也想画独角兽！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "478ea38b223cc9dbef194d80fc6a73c12aa9b1815f22be1f9bb20f51b25cb306",
      "text": "把红色、蓝色搅一搅，\n再添一点黄色。\n搅呀搅，变成棕色啦。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "84b6e027ee370b624e08ba5c6ac926ca988ce968aa811ac6806a459e7185241c",
      "text": "悟空低头一看，\n纸上只有一团棕色颜料。\n“我的独角兽呢？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dad4a0a6be9c89ba2364b2943e141f994a22857b31d10c5505714e13b8d5a123",
      "text": "老师走过来，弯下腰。\n“你再瞧瞧，\n这团颜料像什么？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b1a6feee3f15295f57c5caa7f47d4c0af8d2cfe50ec3df083fa3966684caff0b",
      "text": "悟空想了想，\n添上两只圆耳朵。\n“有啦！是一只小熊！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1445907c1e8952955af90a98f7729c35fcc9dff0fa1bfec8811bee40cb030c3f",
      "text": "两只眼睛，一个鼻子。\n再把小嘴画得弯弯的。\n“小熊笑啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ba313492cc2d58f703584ce105d755e124a694f6ad0a7ebcc97c5a243f3fbe3d",
      "text": "哪吒画上彩虹头发。\n八戒把兔耳朵里面\n涂得粉粉的。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9b2c66df967490e9ef5276b6c34a9bb61efdc42c7189ea5344f05ed4a58aa677",
      "text": "悟空问：“能一起画吗？”\n“好呀！”\n两个小伙伴都点了头。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7dfd6ce739e6c8f379e5b04e4538cd5ecbc4424abe45a251215b579aab3ddbf4",
      "text": "三只画笔忙起来。\n草地连在一起，\n中间还多了一条小路。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e3f4e7e646861ec9dae5cdad617968af30881ee3fa1f82af4c84dc525347a25",
      "text": "悟空又给小熊画了个枕头。\n“画了这么久，\n你也该歇歇啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a06ca11111c7a4a85842f7bbb682f33bf4228dfadaf6ffd8325b2419215d5ce9",
      "text": "洗好画笔，\n把画挂起来。\n大家越看越喜欢。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bcc9f42cb29ea6b6e8a93db437b39bb5fb6c7073fe0957de5fae9cb4c499032c",
      "text": "悟空越看越高兴。\n“这可是咱们一起画的！\n小熊，晚安啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
